<title>UK: Migros Genossenschaftsbund sets 250 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Migros Genossenschaftsbund sets 250 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager UBS Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MIGROS GENOSSENSCHAFTSBUND</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    16.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    16.JUN.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   05.JUN.97</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
